*.html

# Data and earlier assignments stay out of the repo; the final project's own results go in,
# so that both of us see the same tables and can load the same fitted models instead of
# refitting and landing on different numbers.
# Note: the notebook reads ../PA1/imputed_data.csv, which is not in the repo -- keep your own
# copy at that path.
*.csv
*.joblib
!Final Project/tables/*.csv
!Final Project/trained_models/*.joblib

# except the forest: 384 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. Refit it from Section 7.2.
Final Project/trained_models/rsf.joblib
